[14962]="700746FF\n1\tComplete Mission: Evil in the Ruins\030Complete Mission: The Orcs of Nan Wathren\030Complete Mission: The Fortress of Olnathron\030Complete Mission: Orc-thieves\tSpeak with the Hooded Stranger at the Prancing Pony for fresh adventures to journey on during the Anniversary Festival activities. The Hooded Stranger can be found in the Prancing Pony in Bree.\n2\tParticipate in Anniversary Festival activities (total: 10)\tThere is so much to do at the Anniversary Festival. Come and join everyone in celebrating another lovely year and participate in the many Anniversary Festival activities!\n3\tTalk to Waldo Rumble\tWaldo Rumble would like to thank you for your participation in the Anniversary Festival this year.\n",
